{
	title: 'Remove redundant composer gap above the phone keyboard',
	spec: 'The web composer does not add its normal bottom breathing room when the visual viewport has been reduced by the software keyboard. Subtract the space outside the visual viewport from both normal bottom padding and the bottom safe-area allowance, clamping at zero. With the keyboard absent retain the normal minimum spacing and home-indicator safe area. Preserve app viewport geometry, native iOS keyboard toolbar, editor focus and transcript scrolling. Restore the invariant that keyboard-visible bottom spacing does not reserve room already covered by browser keyboard chrome. Verify computed padding in a real browser; the final spacing against the native iOS toolbar requires user device verification.',
